{
  "key_path": "LicenseLimitDescription",
  "content": "The license limit counter consists of: already existing accounts in the workspace and new users that you want to import. If you import users who already have an account in the workspace, they will not be counted again in the counter. Your {{organizationName}} {{productName}} license allows you to have a maximum of {{maxLimit}} users.",
